  "title": "Gekijouban Gundam G no Reconguista",
  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 283929. The films are TMDB movies 648969 (Gundam Reconguista in G Movie I: Go! Core Fighter (2019)), 659896 (Gundam Reconguista in G Movie II: Bellri's Fierce Charge (2020)), 843248 (Gundam Reconguista in G Movie III:  Legacy from Space (2021)), 994311 (Gundam Reconguista in G Movie IV: Love That Cries Out in Battle (2022)), 994319 (Gundam Reconguista in G Movie V: Beyond the Peril of Death (2022)). TMDB show 61414 does not carry it, so the node leaves that show. AniDB S1-S4 (\"富野由悠季インタビューPV（イベント会場公開版）\" (Tomino Yoshiyuki Interview Digest Event Commentary 1) to \"Digest Commentary Storyboard\") have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items); AniDB S5-S10 (\"モビルスーツ学園「帰ってきたＧ-レコ甲子園」 1\" (Mobile Suit Academy: The Return of `G-Reco Koushien` 1) to \"モビルスーツ学園「帰ってきたＧ-レコ甲子園」 6\" (Mobile Suit Academy: The Return of `G-Reco Koushien` 6)) are TVDB S0E16 \"The return of 'G-Reco Koushien' - Episode 1\" to TVDB S0E21 \"The return of 'G-Reco Koushien' - Episode 6\"; AniDB S11-S21 (\"モビルスーツ学園「帰ってきたＧ-レコ甲子園」 7\" (Mobile Suit Academy: The Return of `G-Reco Koushien` 7) to \"「富野由悠季から君へ2 'Update of G'」ドキュメントIII\" (From Yoshiyuki Tomino To You 2 \"Update of G\" Document III (26:11))) have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items). S5-S10 and the five films are matched by their numbers and titles on both sides.",
